in this activity. The Lab Migration team helps in the following ways:</p><ul><li>Provide suggestions on the different ways eSim can be implemented in the laboratory.</li><li>Coordinate the migration of the lab to a FLOSS-only laboratory.</li><li>Provide solutions to the lab\'s problem statements.</li><li>Conduct eSim workshops free of cost.</li></ul>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:9:\"full_html\";}}}}s:9:\"\0*\0fields\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0fieldDefinitions\";N;s:12:\"\0*\0languages\";N;s:14:\"\0*\0langcodeKey\";s:8:\"langcode\";s:21:\"\0*\0defaultLangcodeKey\";s:16:\"default_langcode\";s:17:\"\0*\0activeLangcode\";s:9:\"x-default\";s:28:\"\0*\0enforceDefaultTranslation\";N;s:18:\"\0*\0defaultLangcode\";s:2:\"en\";s:15:\"\0*\0translations\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";a:1:{s:6:\"status\";i:1;}}s:24:\"\0*\0translationInitialize\";b:0;s:14:\"\0*\0newRevision\";b:0;s:20:\"\0*\0isDefaultRevision\";s:1:\"1\";s:13:\"\0*\0entityKeys\";a:4:{s:6:\"bundle\";s:4:\"page\";s:2:\"id\";s:2:\"32\";s:8:\"revision\";s:2:\"64\";s:4:\"uuid\";s:36:\"c4ad3fc4-6d9f-4dbf-978e-ffb14730d7f1\";}s:25:\"\0*\0translatableEntityKeys\";a:8:{s:5:\"label\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:21:\"Lab migration project\";}s:8:\"langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:2:\"en\";}s:6:\"status\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:9:\"published\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:3:\"uid\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:5:\"owner\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:16:\"default_langcode\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";a:1:{s:9:\"x-default\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:12:\"\0*\0validated\";b:0;s:21:\"\0*\0validationRequired\";b:0;s:19:\"\0*\0loadedRevisionId\";s:2:\"64\";s:33:\"\0*\0revisionTranslationAffectedKey\";s:29:\"revision_translation_affected\";s:37:\"\0*\0enforceRevisionTranslationAffected\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0isSyncing\";b:0;s:10:\"in_preview\";N;}',	-1,	1788332815.032,	1,	'entity_field_info',	'0'),
